WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.626 line:88%
Open @BotFather in Telegram and press «Start».

2
00:00:03.676 --> 00:00:05.656 line:88%
Send the /newbot command.

3
00:00:05.706 --> 00:00:08.862 line:88%
Pick the bot's name — it is shown in the chat.

4
00:00:08.912 --> 00:00:12.715 line:88%
Then its username: Latin letters, it must end with «bot».

5
00:00:12.765 --> 00:00:17.274 line:88%
BotFather replies with a token like 123456789:AAH… — copy all of it.

6
00:00:17.324 --> 00:00:21.538 line:88%
In MemuAI: Settings → Telegram. Step 1 is the «Bot token» field.

7
00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:28.413 line:88%
Paste the token (Ctrl+V). It is stored only on this computer.

8
00:00:28.463 --> 00:00:33.149 line:88%
Step 2 — «Connect Telegram»: a QR code and a link, the bot pairs itself.

9
00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:40.310 line:88%
The bot runs while MemuAI Proxy is running.
